        "original_id": "bf6a3e1e-7ed7-5d02-bca0-67ecf6325714",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Weinstein Company, Dimension Films, The Walt Disney Studios\n- Products: Scary Movie 5, Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD, Jack the Writer\n- People: Katrina Bowden, Keith Powell, Maulik Pancholy, Tom Broecker, Jonathan Lutz, James Anderson, Sharon Wilkins\n- Topics: film distribution, guest appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Dimension Films is an American film production company and independent film distribution label that was formerly owned by The Walt Disney Studios and is now owned by The Weinstein Company.\n- Scary Movie 5 was the second film distributed by The Weinstein Company under the Dimension Films brand.\n- Katrina Bowden appeared in the films Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD, and Scary Movie 5.\n- Katrina Bowden, Keith Powell, Maulik Pancholy, Tom Broecker, Jonathan Lutz, James Anderson, and Sharon Wilkins guest starred in the episode Jack the Writer.",
